<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>IndoorLocate – About the App</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .navbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      background: #020617;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      background: #2563eb;
      border: none;
      color: white;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 24px 18px 40px;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #93c5fd;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #d1d5db;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 18px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .box {
      background: #020617;
      border: 1px solid #1e293b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .cta {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 26px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #22c55e;
      color: #022c22;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 18px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
      background: #020617;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="logo">IndoorLocate</div>
    <button class="nav-btn" onclick="window.location.href='/'">Home</button>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">
    <h1>IndoorLocate Android App</h1>

    <p>
      IndoorLocate is a <strong>college project</strong> built for
      <strong>learning and testing purposes only</strong>.
      It helps identify <strong>which classroom or indoor area</strong>
      a user is currently in.
    </p>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>📌 What problem does this solve?</h2>
      <p>
        GPS does not work well inside buildings.
        IndoorLocate uses <strong>Wi-Fi signals</strong> instead to
        detect indoor locations like classrooms or labs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>⚙️ How the app works (simple)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reads the Wi-Fi network your phone is connected to</li>
        <li>Gets the Wi-Fi <strong>BSSID</strong> (router ID)</li>
        <li>Sends only this BSSID to the server</li>
        <li>Server finds the mapped classroom</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="box">
      <h2>🔐 Privacy & permissions</h2>
      <p>
        Your privacy is respected.
        The app <strong>does not collect personal data</strong>.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>❌ No files access</li>
        <li>❌ No contacts</li>
        <li>❌ No camera or microphone</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Android requires <strong>Location permission</strong> only to
        read Wi-Fi information.
        No location history or identity is stored.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href="/download-apk" class="cta">
      ⬇ Download Test APK
    </a>

    <div class="note">
      Android may show “Install unknown apps”. This is normal for test APKs.
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    Final Year Engineering Project • Indoor Location Detection System
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
